    </div>
    <div class="xp-addressbar">
      <span class="xp-addressbar-label">Address</span>
      <div class="xp-addressbar-icon"><i class="fas fa-briefcase"></i></div>
      <span class="xp-addressbar-input">C:\Career\Work Experience</span>
    </div>
    <div class="xp-explorer-layout">
      <!-- Tree View Sidebar -->
      <div class="xp-explorer-sidebar">
        <ul class="xp-tree">
          <li>
            <div class="xp-tree-item">
              <span class="xp-tree-toggle">-</span>
              <i class="fas fa-desktop xp-tree-icon" style="color:#3a6ea5;"></i>
              <span class="xp-tree-label">My Computer</span>
            </div>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <div class="xp-tree-item">
                  <span class="xp-tree-toggle">-</span>
                  <i class="fas fa-hdd xp-tree-icon" style="color:#888;"></i>
                  <span class="xp-tree-label">C:\Career</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                  <li>
                    <div class="xp-tree-item selected">
                      <span class="xp-tree-toggle">-</span>
                      <i class="fas fa-folder-open xp-tree-icon"></i>
                      <span class="xp-tree-label">Work Experience</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul>
                      <li>
                        <div class="xp-tree-item"><i class="fas fa-folder xp-tree-icon"></i> <span
                          class="xp-tree-label">EmTech Care Labs</span></div>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                          <div class="xp-tree-item"><i class="fas fa-folder xp-tree-icon"></i> <span
                            class="xp-tree-label">AllFactors</span></div>
                          </li>
                          <li>
                            <div class="xp-tree-item"><i class="fas fa-folder xp-tree-icon"></i> <span
                              class="xp-tree-label">Smart Meal</span></div>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                              <div class="xp-tree-item"><i class="fas fa-folder xp-tree-icon"></i> <span
                                class="xp-tree-label">Pentalight</span></div>
                              </li>
                            </ul>
                          </li>
                        </ul>
                      </li>
                    </ul>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <!-- Detail Pane -->
              <div class="xp-explorer-main">
                <!-- Job 1 -->
                <div class="xp-detail-pane">
                  <div class="xp-job-header">
                    <div>
                      <div class="xp-job-title">Senior Software Engineer</div>
                      <div class="xp-job-company">EmTech Care Labs | Portland, ME</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="xp-job-date">Jan 2025 - Present</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="xp-job-description">
                    Lead engineer on an Alzheimer's care platform on AWS, where 200+ caregivers and patients
                    message each other and share care plans. I folded three web and mobile codebases into one
                    TypeScript monorepo and did the security work (encryption, audit logs, access control) that
                    got us through an outside HIPAA readiness review with no critical findings. The ML features
                    are mine too: a decline-risk model and an NLP pipeline for clinical notes. I also mentor two
                    junior engineers.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <hr class="xp-job-separator">

                <!-- Job 2 -->
                <div class="xp-detail-pane">
                  <div class="xp-job-header">
                    <div>
                      <div class="xp-job-title">Senior Software Engineer</div>
                      <div class="xp-job-company">AllFactors | Santa Clara, CA</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="xp-job-date">Oct 2021 - Dec 2024</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="xp-job-description">
                    Moved an old ASP.NET Web Forms real-estate analytics app to Blazor WebAssembly, and pages
                    got about twice as fast. I built the live pricing feed (SignalR plus SQL Server change
                    tracking) that pushed updates to hundreds of users in under a second, along with the
                    component library all the dashboards were built from. The valuation and forecast models
                    behind those dashboards retrained every night on the day's transactions.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <hr class="xp-job-separator">

                <!-- Job 3 -->
                <div class="xp-detail-pane">
                  <div class="xp-job-header">
                    <div>
                      <div class="xp-job-title">Software Engineer</div>
                      <div class="xp-job-company">Smart Meal Service | Russia</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="xp-job-date">Sep 2020 - Jul 2021</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="xp-job-description">
                    Wrote the C# software that ran a self-service food kiosk and a robotic cashier, payment
                    terminal and hardware protocols included. I also built the customer ordering app (Xamarin)
                    and the admin dashboard (ASP.NET Core and Angular). A hardware abstraction layer let the
                    same code run on all three machine models, and orders went to the right kitchen station
                    automatically.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <hr class="xp-job-separator">

                <!-- Job 4 -->
                <div class="xp-detail-pane">
                  <div class="xp-job-header">
                    <div>
                      <div class="xp-job-title">Game Developer</div>
                      <div class="xp-job-company">Pentalight Technology | Malaysia</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="xp-job-date">Mar 2020 - Feb 2021</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="xp-job-description">
                    Built multiplayer networking, spatial audio, hand tracking, and the in-world UI for a VR
                    smart-city simulation in Unity, plus a desktop client for anyone without a headset. Scene
                    builds used to take hours of hands-on work. After I automated the art pipeline (model
                    import, LODs, light baking), an artist could start one and walk away.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="xp-statusbar">
              <span class="xp-statusbar-section">4 objects</span>
              <span class="xp-statusbar-section"><i class="fas fa-briefcase"></i> Work Experience</span>
            </div>
