                    <div class="xp-email-header">
                      <div class="xp-email-from">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope-open" style="color: #e8b030;"></i>
                        <strong>David Chen</strong> — CEO at NovaBridge Solutions
                      </div>
                      <div class="xp-email-rating">★★★★★</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="xp-email-body">
                      "Sukhrob is one of the most versatile developers I've worked with. He took a vague product idea and turned
                      it into a polished, production-ready application in just 8 weeks. His ability to handle everything from
                      database design to pixel-perfect UI is genuinely impressive. Already planning our next project together."
